{"resource": {"name": "Residential & Commercial Alarms", "id": "wwn8-sipn", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset shows detailed information related to the operation of the City's Metro Alarm Office, including the number of permits issued and the number of false alarms recorded each month.\n\nPlease note: From July 2017-present, the columns \"False Alarms\" and False Alarms Historical\" are identical. Prior to the ordnance passed in June 2017, the only false alarms that could be counted were those verified and matched by MPD's reporting database. This is reflected in the \"False Alarms\" column, pre July 2017. In order to get a true reflection of the volume of historical false alarms, dispatched records were matched and aggregated. This is reflected in the column \"False Alarms Historical,\" pre July 2017.", "attribution": "City of Memphis", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-08-23T15:13:41.000Z", "createdAt": "2018-10-15T18:52:30.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-08-23T15:13:40.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2024-08-23T15:13:41.000Z", "columns_name": ["Year", "Date", "Businesses Added", "False Alarm_Historical", "Gross Billing", "False Alarms", "Total Collected", "False Alarms Charged", "Alarm-related Collections", "Other Collections", "Residential Added", "Month", "Account-related Collections", "Charges", "Month_Order"], "columns_field_name": ["year", "date", "businesses_added", "false_alarm_historical", "gross_billing", "false_alarms", "total_collected", "false_alarms_charged", "alarm_related_collections", "other_collections", "residential_added", "month", "account_related_collections", "charges", "month_order"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Calendar date", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Number"], "columns_description": ["Reporting year", "Reporting month & year (date rounds to 1st of the month)", "Commercial alarm pe